# Allow only package sources, metadata, docs needed for builds and configs.
**
!Dockerfile
!README.md
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!src/
!src/**
!docs/
!docs/architecture.md
!configs/
!configs/*.yaml
# Never include generated files nested under an allowed directory.
**/__pycache__/**
**/*.pyc
**/.env*
**/*.csv
**/*.joblib
**/*.pkl
